{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Heimdall federated analysis API",
    "description": "Heimdall HTTP API -- the contract the researcher UI (frontend/) talks to.\n\n    SERVER_OUT=server/api_out uvicorn server.api:app --port 8500 --workers 1\n\nStart mock TREs separately with `python scripts/dev_tres.py`. Neither TREs nor\nFLARE are required for startup or /health. API_TRE_TIMEOUT (seconds per HTTP\noperation, default 10) and API_TRE_WORKERS (default 8) control adapter fan-out;\nAPI_CORS_ORIGINS (comma-separated, default http://localhost:3000) allows the UI\norigin. Use an exclusive SERVER_OUT directory; see analysis_service's\nconcurrency and demo-versus-secure-deployment notes. Variable names are\ncanonical (snp_rs001), never local column names; requests carry variable\nnames, never participant data. Response shapes: server/schemas.py, exported to\ndocs/schemas/ and served at /openapi.json.\n",
    "version": "0.2.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/health": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Health",
        "operationId": "health_health_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/allele-frequency": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Allele Frequency",
        "operationId": "allele_frequency_allele_frequency_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "variant",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "title": "Variant"
